;   layers/   what games are made of: Camera2d, Sprite, Tilemap
;   apis/     its face of each library a program calls: Physics (lib_physics),
;             Gui (lib_gui)
;   ways/     other ways to write a program on it: Bigbang (How to Design
;             Programs' world)
;   platforms/  the platforms, each a library of its own (ppm, sdl; and
;             Plan 9's: draw, software)
; copied and shortened (each file says). A program is linked with it and
; with one platform. The folders are folders only: one library.
